      "And every night after that, when Maya looked at any light — a lamp, a candle, a star — she would smile, knowing that inside every glow was a whole world of beauty, just waiting for someone to look carefully enough to see it. Sleep well, little light-seeker. Your own inner light is the most magical lantern of all."
