      "Every night when six-year-old Theo pressed his head against his pillow, he thought he could hear the faintest sound — like tiny voices singing a lullaby too quiet to quite make out. His mother always said it was just his imagination, but Theo was sure it was something more.",
      "One night, Theo decided to investigate. He waited until the house was completely quiet, then he very carefully lifted the corner of his pillow. What he saw made his eyes grow wide with amazement.",
