      "Theo watched as Slumberlings bustled about their work. Some were carrying tiny dreams that looked like glowing bubbles. Others were using miniature brushes to paint colors onto dreams — adding extra sunshine to a happy dream or extra stars to an adventure dream.",
      "'That one is for you tonight,' King Pippin said, pointing to a dream in a silver basket that glowed with a gentle, peaceful light. 'It is a dream about flying over an ocean made of clouds. We made it extra soft for you because we know you had a busy day.'",
      "Theo was touched. 'You make my dreams just for me?'",
