      "Theo spent the rest of the evening watching the Slumberlings work. He helped them polish a dream about a underwater garden until it sparkled. He helped sort a batch of adventure dreams that had gotten mixed up. And he helped the royal baker make dream-cookies — tiny treats that made dreams taste like warm honey.",
      "'You are a good friend to the Pillow Kingdom,' King Pippin said. 'Most children never discover us. But now that you know, you are welcome to visit anytime. Just lift the corner of your pillow after lights out.'",
