      "He fell asleep smiling, dreaming of flying over an ocean of clouds that tasted like warm honey. And under his pillow, the Slumberlings cheered softly as his dream began — another perfect night in the Pillow Kingdom. Sleep well, little one. Your own Pillow Kingdom is preparing a beautiful dream for you right now."
