      "At the center of the garden, resting on a bed of the softest sand, was the Moon Pearl. It was even more beautiful than Coral had imagined — its light was warm and gentle, like a nightlight made of captured moonbeams. When Coral approached, the pearl's light pulsed gently, as if welcoming her.",
