      "As she sang, the Moon Pearl's light grew brighter and began to spread. It floated upward through the water like a luminous bubble, rising toward the surface. Coral watched as it carried its peaceful light up through every layer of the ocean, past the fish she had helped, past the turtle she had freed, all the way to the surface where it burst into a thousand tiny moonbeams that scattered across the night sky.",
